WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.340
- Let's wrap up this hour

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:02.790
with one last feel-good story,

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.260
sure to bring you some joy.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.592
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.592 --> 00:00:06.944
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.944 --> 00:00:09.070
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.570
Y'all meet 10 year-old Caiden.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.650
With his mastery of double
back flips and double whips,

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.120
he's already a champion BMX athlete,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.520
racking up big wins worldwide

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.700
against kids as old as 16.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.390
He's 10 and he's just
getting started y'all.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.580
Caiden's now set his sights on
the X Games and the Olympics.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.630
We have this young man with big talent

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.730
on the line right now.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:32.804
What's up, Caiden.

00:00:32.804 --> 00:00:34.756
(audience cheering)

00:00:34.756 --> 00:00:35.800
- Kelly.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.141
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:37.141 --> 00:00:40.180
First of all, congratulations,
I'm so proud of you.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.860
This is so awesome, you're killing it.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:47.130
And I gotta ask you, how
did you get into BMX?

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.860
- So, my dad would always go

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.100
to the dirt bike track and stuff with me.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.010
So, I would used to ride my PW,

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:59.500
my little dirt bike when I was one,

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.890
and then ever since I rode my dirt bike,

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:07.890
I just go straight to my push bike.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:08.760
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.640
The one picture of you flying
in the air like Superman.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.280
How does your mom deal with that?

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:16.290
That's scary, man.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.870
Oh my gosh, you're so high in the air.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:19.900
You're unbelievable.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.770
So, I hear you're working on
new tricks right now, right?

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:26.530
- Yeah, I'm trying to do triple whips,

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:27.870
flare bars,

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.940
triple back flips.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.060
- What?

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.020
Oh my gosh.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:35.310
(audience applauding)

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:37.340
You are incredible, I love it.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.430
You're so fearless.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.800
Thank you so much, Caiden.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.847
We're all just watching
you, we're supporting you,

00:01:41.847 --> 00:01:44.032
and we're rooting for you, alright?

00:01:44.032 --> 00:01:45.030
(audience applauding)

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:45.863
- Yeah.

00:01:45.863 --> 00:01:48.123
- Alright, I'm liking
your posts right now.

00:01:49.529 --> 00:01:50.650
And that's not all,

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.400
our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.000
the go to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.100
they want to honor ultimate overachievers,

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.270
just like you, my man.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.270
So, they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1,000.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.245
How does that sound?

00:02:02.245 --> 00:02:03.677
(audience cheering)

00:02:03.677 --> 00:02:05.127
- A thousand?

00:02:05.127 --> 00:02:08.031
Oh my gosh, that's so good.

00:02:08.031 --> 00:02:09.114
- Absolutely.

00:02:09.114 --> 00:02:10.760
- [Caiden] That means so much.

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:13.503
- We are so proud of you,
Caiden, keep killing it.

